notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T14:24:18.713Z","harness:codex","author=codex,text=Installed @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.26, pm-changelog 2026.9.25, pm-ops 2026.9.26. Copied the exact pm-ops canonical prepare launcher; regenerated committed selfhost.bundle. Full release:check passed 789/789 tests, 0 skipped, c8 100/100/100/100, native TOON and strace acceptance, self-host source identity, zero production audit findings, npm pack dry run, changelog and attestation gates. Strict PM health passed with an existing advisory provenance warning."
  "2026-09-29T13:24:09.460Z",codex,"Fresh npm/npx and Bun/bunx projects installed packed pm-vcs 2026.7.30 with published CLI 2026.9.29. Both package installs reported copy.complete=true and activated the extension; each initialized native pm-vcs, staged and committed a real text file, then passed strict PM health with zero warnings. This was on the code-identical artifact before the local pin edit; exact new-head full gate and committed self-host bundle revalidation follow."
